      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thank you for reporting this issue! Unfortunately, remote player colliders have always worked this way - so it's not a bug we can fix without breaking existing content.\n\nI *would* consider it a bug, though! It's something we should probably fix eventually.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
